TITLE: 
    Mulder, Voelkle, and Hamaker (working)
    Population model - Bivariate VAR(1) with Markov chain X and continuous Y
    Estimation model - ARX(1) model (with covariate adjustment)
    No aggregation, analyzing every observation.

DATA:
    FILE = dfList_m1_every1.dat;
    TYPE = MONTECARLO;

VARIABLE: 
    NAMES = X L Y frame unit;
    USEVARIABLES = X L Y;
    LAGGED = Y(1);
   
ANALYSIS: 
    ESTIMATOR = BAYES;
    PROCESSOR = 4;
    BITERATION = (1000);

MODEL: 
    Y ON 0.5*Y&1 0.5*X 0.8*L;

SAVEDATA:
    RESULTS = results_m1_every1.dat;






